ong with t-cell il-10 expression and  promotes t-cell grant sign b and  k-l-r-g-1 expression consistent with a  short-lived effector phenotype  and given these  really broad differences in the effects  of cd40 agonist and pdl1 blockade  it is not surprising that these two  therapies synergize  and further benefit in the absence of  tdf receptor signaling which is really  intriguing and again a main  a main direction for us moving forward  a couple quick acknowledgments firstly  and most importantly incan  inconstrumness for the opportunity to do  the work in her lab  and everybody in the lab too many to  thank  and our our new r01 on this project  thank you again for the opportunity  um i'll be happy to answer any questions
 

